{"content":"Implemented the fix for repositories containing a `.*` ignore pattern.\n\n### Changes\n- Ensured the explicitly requested traversal root is never evaluated as an ignored entry.\n- Applied the fix to:\n  - `ListDirectory`, used by `/` file completion.\n  - `GlobWithDoubleStar`, used by fallback glob traversal.\n- Preserved ignore handling for all child files and directories, including hidden entries.\n- Added regression tests covering:\n  - Visible root and nested files remaining discoverable with `.*`.\n  - Hidden files remaining excluded.\n  - Fallback glob traversal continuing beneath the root.\n\n### Verification\n- Inspected the final edited source for syntax, formatting, and behavior.\n- Attempted to run `gofmt` followed by `go test ./internal/fsext`.\n- Verification was blocked because `gofmt` is not installed in the environment; consequently, the dependent test command was skipped. The edited code is manually formatted according to standard Go formatting.","type":"text"}
